### Auth API samples (via Gateway)
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth

### Register
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo1",
  "email": "demo1@example.com",
  "password": "Secret123!",
  "fullName": "Demo User"
}

### Login
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo1",
  "password": "Secret123!"
}

### Me (set token)
# @name me
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### MFA setup
POST {{base}}/mfa/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### MFA enable
POST {{base}}/mfa/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456"
}

### Refresh
POST {{base}}/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout
POST {{base}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin login
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}
